ssName=\"material-icons !text-lg\">star</span>\n              <span className=\"material-icons !text-lg\">star</span>\n              <span className=\"material-icons !text-lg\">star</span>\n              <span className=\"material-icons !text-lg\">star_half</span>\n            </div>\n            <span className=\"text-xs text-gray-400 dark500 font-semibold\">(128 reseñas)</span>\n          </div>\n    \n          <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 mb-6\">\n            Cámara de 200MP, pantalla AMOLED de 120Hz y la potencia que necesitas para tu día a día.\n          </p>\n    \n          <div className=\"mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-gray-100 dark800/50 flex justify-between items-end\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col\">\n              <span className=\"text-xs text-gray-400 dark500 line-through font-medium mb-1\">$350.00</span>\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span className=\"text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark tracking-tighter\">$299.99</span>\n                <span className=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 dark500/10 dark400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg\">\n                  -14%\n                </span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n    \n            <button className=\"h-12 w-12 bg-orange-600 hover500 text-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-orange-600/30 transition-all active90 flex items-center justify-center group/btn\">\n              <span className=\"material-icons !text-2xl group-hover/btn12 transition-transform\">shopping_cart</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
