ss=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 mb-6\">\n        Cámara de 200MP, pantalla AMOLED de 120Hz y la potencia que necesitas para tu día a día.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800/50 flex justify-between items-end\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 line-through font-medium mb-1\">$350.00</span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tighter\">$299.99</span>\n            <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 dark:text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg\">\n              -14%\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"h-12 w-12 bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-orange-600/30 transition-all active:scale-90 flex items-center justify-center group/btn\">\n          <span class=\"material-icons !text-2xl group-hover/btn:rotate-12 transition-transform\">shopping_cart</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>"
